      "message": "Merge main into issue/2002-tool-properties (pages.rs: port main's edits into the moved tool editor)\n\nThe PR moved the tool editor body to tool_settings.rs and the preview to\ntool_preview.rs; main edited both in place in pages.rs:\n- #2026 (left-hand taps): tap-hand check row ported into tool_settings.rs;\n  tap_hand_tests module kept in pages.rs.\n- #2010 (body preview): the body replaces the parameter holder, ported into\n  tool_preview::draw; tests/tool_preview.rs now hangs off tool_preview.rs\n  via a test-only draw_tool_preview wrapper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
